<title>USA: Wellington holds 10.45 pct Beazer stake.</title>
<headline>Wellington holds 10.45 pct Beazer stake.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wellington Management Co said in a Securities and Exchange Commission filing Monday it holds a 10.45 percent stake in Beazer Homes USA Inc or 739,700 common shares.</p>
<p>Wellington disclosed its latest position on Beazer in a 13G filing.</p>
<p>Filings under 13G are usually made by institutions and large investors with &quot;passive&quot; investment objectives in a company. Unlike 13D filings, those reports do not list the latest transactions.</p>
</text>
